<div class="app-shell">
  <aside class="sidebar" aria-label="Primary navigation">
    <div class="brand-mark"><span>O</span><div><strong>{{ shop.name }}</strong><small>CLINICAL ORDERING</small></div></div>
    <div class="workspace-label">SHOPIFY WORKSPACE</div>
    <nav class="nav-list">
      <button class="nav-item active" data-view="workspace"><span class="nav-icon">＋</span>New case</button>
      <button class="nav-item" data-view="inventory"><span class="nav-icon">⌕</span>Hardware library</button>
      <a class="nav-item" href="{{ routes.cart_url }}"><span class="nav-icon">▤</span>Cart</a>
    </nav>
    <div class="sidebar-bottom"><div class="sidebar-status"><span></span><div><b>Shopify storefront online</b><small>Inventory managed by Shopify</small></div></div></div>
  </aside>
  <main class="main-content">
    <header class="topbar"><button class="mobile-menu" aria-label="Open navigation">☰</button><div class="breadcrumbs"><span>{{ shop.name }}</span><b>/</b><strong>Fracture planning</strong></div><div class="top-actions"><a class="text-btn" href="{{ routes.account_url }}">Account</a><a class="text-btn" href="{{ routes.cart_url }}">Cart ({{ cart.item_count }})</a></div></header>
    <div id="workspace-view" class="view active-view">
      <section class="page-heading workspace-heading"><div><div class="eyebrow">NEW CASE · STEP 01 OF 03</div><h1>Plan the repair<br><em>with better context.</em></h1><p>Upload radiographs and prepare a hardware request for clinician review.</p></div></section>
      <div class="workspace-grid"><section class="upload-panel"><div class="panel-title"><div><span class="step-number">01</span><div><h2>Radiographs</h2><p>Upload clear AP, lateral, or oblique views.</p></div></div><span class="secure-tag">UPLOAD READY</span></div><label class="dropzone" id="dropzone"><input id="xray-input" type="file" accept="image/*,.dcm" hidden><div class="upload-icon">↥</div><b>Drop images here or <u>browse files</u></b><small>PNG, JPG, or DICOM · up to 50 MB each</small></label><div id="file-list" class="file-list"></div><div class="upload-foot"><span>Files are not sent to Shopify</span><button class="text-btn" id="sample-btn">Load sample case →</button></div></section><section class="details-panel"><div class="panel-title"><div><span class="step-number">02</span><div><h2>Case context</h2><p>Capture details for your clinical workflow.</p></div></div></div><div class="form-grid"><label>Patient reference<input id="patient-name" placeholder="e.g. Maple · 00482"></label><label>Species<select id="species"><option>Canine</option><option>Feline</option></select></label><label>Weight (kg)<input id="weight" type="number" placeholder="e.g. 22"></label><label>Study view<select id="view-type"><option>Multiple views</option><option>AP</option><option>Lateral</option></select></label></div><label class="full-label">Clinical notes<textarea id="clinical-notes" rows="3" placeholder="Mechanism, injury timing, relevant findings..."></textarea></label><button class="primary-btn full" id="assess-btn" disabled>Prepare review <span>→</span></button></section></div>
      <section class="assessment-panel" id="assessment-panel"><div class="assessment-empty"><span class="ai-mark">✦</span><div><h2>Review workspace</h2><p>AI processing can be connected later through a secure app backend.</p></div><span class="review-note">Clinician approval required</span></div></section>
    </div>
    <div id="inventory-view" class="view"><section class="page-heading compact"><div><div class="eyebrow">SHOPIFY PRODUCT CATALOG</div><h1>Procedure-ready hardware.</h1><p>Products and availability are rendered from your Shopify catalog.</p></div></section><div class="catalog-layout"><div class="results-area"><div class="search-row"><label class="search-field"><span>⌕</span><input id="search-input" type="search" placeholder="Search product or SKU..."></label></div><div class="results-meta"><b>{{ collections.all.products_count }} products available</b></div><div id="product-grid" class="product-grid">{% for product in collections.all.products limit: 24 %}<article class="product-card"><div class="product-visual">{% if product.featured_image %}<img src="{{ product.featured_image | image_url: width: 800 }}" alt="{{ product.featured_image.alt | escape | default: product.title | escape }}">{% endif %}<span class="stock-badge">Available</span></div><div class="product-info"><span class="product-type">{{ product.type | default: 'Hardware' }} · {{ product.handle }}</span><h3>{{ product.title }}</h3><p>{{ product.description | strip_html | truncate: 90 }}</p><div class="product-bottom"><div><b>{{ product.price | money }}</b><small>Shopify catalog</small></div><button class="add-btn" data-variant-id="{{ product.selected_or_first_available_variant.id }}" aria-label="Add {{ product.title | escape }}">＋</button></div></div></article>{% else %}<p>No products have been added to Shopify yet.</p>{% endfor %}</div></div><aside class="order-rail"><div class="rail-heading"><div><span class="eyebrow">SHOPIFY CART</span><h2 id="rail-title">{{ cart.item_count }} items selected</h2></div><span class="cart-count" id="cart-count">{{ cart.item_count }}</span></div><div id="rail-items" class="rail-items"><div class="rail-empty"><p>Add hardware to build a request.</p></div></div><div class="rail-footer"><a class="primary-btn full" href="{{ routes.cart_url }}">Review cart <span>→</span></a></div></aside></div></div>
  </main>
</div>
<div class="toast" id="toast" role="status"></div>
